---
// src/components/About.astro
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 px-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        
        <!-- COLUMNA 1: IMAGE / PORTRAIT -->
        <div class="relative group">
            <!-- Glow rojo de fondo -->
            <div class="absolute -inset-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-700 to-red-900 rounded-2xl blur opacity-30 group-hover:opacity-60 transition duration-500"></div>
            
            <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-neutral-950 border border-red-900/40 aspect-square flex items-center justify-center shadow-2xl shadow-red-950/20">
                <img 
                    src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/aa71f3_2b5ab5785b3549388e56ec7d071bcd6b~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_620,h_362,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/aa71f3_2b5ab5785b3549388e56ec7d071bcd6b~mv2.jpg" 
                    alt="Lucas - Photographer & Videographer" 
                    class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500 grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0"
                />
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- COLUMNA 2: ABOUT CONTENT -->
        <div class="space-y-6">
            <span class="text-red-500 font-mono tracking-widest uppercase text-xs font-semibold">
                // About Me
            </span>

            <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-white uppercase">
                Capturing moments & telling stories through the lens.
            </h2>

            <p class="text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed font-sans">
                My name is <strong class="text-white font-bold">Lucas</strong> and I am a Photographer/Videographer based in Phoenix, Arizona. I am passionate about storytelling and capturing the essence of a moment through the lens. I enjoy all subjects of photography in my work, but specialize in <span class="text-red-500 font-medium">concert & event photography</span> as well as <span class="text-red-500 font-medium">creative videography</span>.
            </p>

            <p class="text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed font-sans">
                Outside of my photography work, I enjoy playing guitar, writing poetry, attending concerts, and playing with my 5 dogs. I also love to travel and experience different cultures, food, and ways of life.
            </p>

            <blockquote class="border-l-2 border-red-600 pl-4 py-1 text-neutral-300 italic bg-red-950/10 rounded-r-lg">
                "Thank you for checking out my work!"
            </blockquote>

            <!-- FEATURE BADGES -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
                <div class="bg-neutral-950 border border-red-900/30 p-4 rounded-xl shadow-lg">
                    <span class="block text-lg font-mono font-bold text-red-500">Phoenix, AZ</span>
                    <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-500">Location</span>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-neutral-950 border border-red-900/30 p-4 rounded-xl shadow-lg">
                    <span class="block text-lg font-mono font-bold text-red-500">Concerts & Events</span>
                    <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-500">Specialty</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>